        "¶s2 and 3 explain the reasons why pseudoscience and medicine often go together and why pseudoscientists are successful in convincing others of their claims.",
        "¶s4 and 5 give an example of the difficulties in refuting claims of pseudoscience and in distinguishing between real and pseudo-science (offering a metaphor to show that the distinction is real).",
