        "¶6 argues that the campaign against media violence is part of a long American tradition of moral crusades.",
        "¶7 argues that by any measure, the amount of violence caused by media violence is very small.",
        "¶8 accepts that media violence contributes to a climate of violence but argues that it is not a significant factor in triggering violence.",
